    {
      "id": "arpi-ar",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Androgen receptor pathway inhibitor (ARPI) (ar)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "arpi",
      "language": "ar",
      "available": true,
      "text": "حبوب الهرمونات الأحدث لسرطان البروستاتا (abiraterone وenzalutamide وapalutamide وdarolutamide) التي تحجب مستقبل الأندروجين أو الخطوات الأخيرة في إنتاج الأندروجين، وتُستخدم إضافة إلى الكبت المعياري للتستوستيرون.",
      "selectedTextSha256": "6f6c2341ac5ae57676b7eb7300952a6873ccb1dc50dda775bc7f265a28587e83",
      "renderSha256": "65bb25332e2157fac400a9b94e2755cf7996f48f6b9294f9cf89fc18a079fa6a"
    },
    {
      "id": "arpi-de",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Androgen receptor pathway inhibitor (ARPI) (de)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "arpi",
      "language": "de",
      "available": true,
      "text": "Die neueren Hormontabletten gegen Prostatakrebs (Abirateron, Enzalutamid, Apalutamid, Darolutamid), die den Androgenrezeptor oder die letzten Schritte der Androgenproduktion blockieren und zusätzlich zur üblichen Testosteronunterdrückung eingesetzt werden.",
      "selectedTextSha256": "5d1c8344661fcb2c2c2800d4129a3327710211835e9ed636c8edc63284eb8894",
      "renderSha256": "55358aa8f6b8e979ffd1acfb73bfa2e325b12cad98d84acfba818e4417f9427f"
    },
    {
      "id": "arpi-es",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Androgen receptor pathway inhibitor (ARPI) (es)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "arpi",
      "language": "es",
      "available": true,
      "text": "Las píldoras hormonales más nuevas para el cáncer de próstata (abiraterona, enzalutamida, apalutamida, darolutamida) que bloquean el receptor de andrógenos o los últimos pasos de la producción de andrógenos, usadas además de la supresión estándar de testosterona.",
      "selectedTextSha256": "0beedf02f972cbb05249c3865362a9bf84ba92d6394653544f6c39a41d6d8524",
      "renderSha256": "4cc1f961376383a6f1a4354d56b2a039c87ccf14b273f27b9cd32b2035338871"
    },
    {
      "id": "arpi-fr",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Androgen receptor pathway inhibitor (ARPI) (fr)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "arpi",
      "language": "fr",
      "available": true,
      "text": "Les nouveaux comprimés hormonaux du cancer de la prostate (abiratérone, enzalutamide, apalutamide, darolutamide) qui bloquent le récepteur des androgènes ou les dernières étapes de la production d'androgènes, utilisés en plus de la suppression standard de la testostérone.",
      "selectedTextSha256": "114bdf367113b755ff4eacd259932a6318929efebfb88d6995289fc3ef374b0e",
      "renderSha256": "3fdc72b8faca1af679efd22aa91fffeb22cfb6277718cc94007e9f062e8bb61f"
    },
    {
      "id": "arpi-hi",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Androgen receptor pathway inhibitor (ARPI) (hi)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "arpi",
      "language": "hi",
      "available": true,
      "text": "प्रोस्टेट कैंसर की नई हार्मोन गोलियां (abiraterone, enzalutamide, apalutamide, darolutamide) जो एंड्रोजन रिसेप्टर या एंड्रोजन उत्पादन के अंतिम चरणों को रोकती हैं, और मानक टेस्टोस्टेरोन दमन के साथ दी जाती हैं।",
      "selectedTextSha256": "763f7dcee2075dc86df9427f9824f8a1021f2756714b944aa7f119b49134b930",
      "renderSha256": "8f8a18746e5977f422728f57a2ca3ebf9beb66dbe6de8ef552a7ddd38b51bdbb"
    },
    {
      "id": "arpi-ja",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Androgen receptor pathway inhibitor (ARPI) (ja)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "arpi",
      "language": "ja",
      "available": true,
      "text": "前立腺がんの新しいホルモン内服薬（abiraterone、enzalutamide、apalutamide、darolutamide）で、アンドロゲン受容体またはアンドロゲン産生の最終段階を阻害し、標準的なテストステロン抑制療法に上乗せして使われる。",
      "selectedTextSha256": "4fdc6ec049699ce8144e08f40fe4e224407080ca04c46e22a4966859594507ca",
      "renderSha256": "b0d992c3e1738e095122c803e532cfd547bc786f65a636c94851515856bdc8e1"
    },
    {
      "id": "arpi-pt",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Androgen receptor pathway inhibitor (ARPI) (pt)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "arpi",
      "language": "pt",
      "available": true,
      "text": "Os comprimidos hormonais mais novos para câncer de próstata (abiraterona, enzalutamida, apalutamida, darolutamida) que bloqueiam o receptor de androgênio ou as últimas etapas da produção de androgênios, usados em adição à supressão padrão de testosterona.",
      "selectedTextSha256": "58cd8156a1f33a6045c9a79431d1909249f993e854d859e32d7b875b199075c1",
      "renderSha256": "dedf7181dede3595b4f163f09d0ff3533b1231464b20a202ee0bb5d79ddcfe65"
    },
    {
      "id": "arpi-zh",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Androgen receptor pathway inhibitor (ARPI) (zh)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "arpi",
      "language": "zh",
      "available": true,
      "text": "较新的前列腺癌激素口服药（abiraterone、enzalutamide、apalutamide、darolutamide），可阻断雄激素受体或雄激素生成的最后几步，在标准睾酮抑制的基础上使用。",
      "selectedTextSha256": "38028d207d49eff57bac242e725f839649b31bb31a11a92b80e1d1b916c633b3",
      "renderSha256": "dcc7056a7a98dbf21afce17b189caef90d830cdb842fa7356998347764a4d8d2"
    },
    {
      "id": "arpi-simple",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Androgen receptor pathway inhibitor (ARPI) (simple)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "arpi",
      "language": "simple",
      "available": true,
      "text": "An androgen receptor pathway inhibitor is one of the newer prostate cancer hormone pills that block the testosterone receptor or its production, used on top of standard hormone suppression.",
