    {
      "id": "egfr-ar",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "EGFR (ar)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "egfr",
      "language": "ar",
      "available": true,
      "text": "مستقبل نمو يكون متحوّراً في بعض سرطانات الرئة ومفرَط الإنتاج في أخرى؛ وهو أول نجاح كبير للأقراص الموجهة.",
      "selectedTextSha256": "9725b63b899057570cade4a929ec37fa652a9c6406cb444a84659865daa22b85",
      "renderSha256": "107cf41b03687e6c3b48ebbb82d04c779553469b4b8e58d8331483961a32dd59"
    },
    {
      "id": "egfr-de",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "EGFR (de)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "egfr",
      "language": "de",
      "available": true,
      "text": "Ein Wachstumsrezeptor, der bei manchen Lungenkrebsarten mutiert und bei anderen überproduziert ist; der erste große Erfolg zielgerichteter Tabletten.",
      "selectedTextSha256": "22a4876440a56f67bccf3054b5c142f933e412b6b7f5e726ebda4d059665c311",
      "renderSha256": "fb93e653b3036de9af8235f957cb6d8ec610df2721c4f3c2d2e47307b92ef6ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "egfr-es",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "EGFR (es)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "egfr",
      "language": "es",
      "available": true,
      "text": "Un receptor de crecimiento mutado en algunos cánceres de pulmón y sobreproducido en otros; el primer gran éxito de las pastillas dirigidas.",
      "selectedTextSha256": "2325e18f6c02d6c8330d18557ac65727eb5d316f3c1c299c1bca87bac85489f5",
      "renderSha256": "9f8f9c1ccdbb84ad7b0a71f399163bbbf7097ea0f1da09df35eaf474a705c0c0"
    },
    {
      "id": "egfr-fr",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "EGFR (fr)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "egfr",
      "language": "fr",
      "available": true,
      "text": "Un récepteur de croissance muté dans certains cancers du poumon et surproduit dans d'autres ; le premier grand succès des comprimés ciblés.",
      "selectedTextSha256": "234561bbbb6d17670c804704e8e5c8797fe7e3f9844d16718919374ecdb6bc2f",
      "renderSha256": "8e36b827b813c9fe1f37b54e414a75f3e8c9616a639408f95a144d293f181998"
    },
    {
      "id": "egfr-hi",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "EGFR (hi)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "egfr",
      "language": "hi",
      "available": true,
      "text": "कुछ फेफड़े के कैंसरों में म्यूटेट और अन्य में अत्यधिक बनने वाला वृद्धि रिसेप्टर; लक्षित गोलियों की पहली बड़ी सफलता।",
      "selectedTextSha256": "384ba67480808be5c4732dee6eb5527dd273bf7a1aabc8b46a1a6a27f2820d12",
      "renderSha256": "364652ed37d2eeaa208c4787a01105edf96aff61237407e4e2bf1bd83d3aea0e"
    },
    {
      "id": "egfr-ja",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "EGFR (ja)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "egfr",
      "language": "ja",
      "available": true,
      "text": "一部の肺がんでは変異し、別の肺がんでは過剰に作られている増殖受容体。分子標的薬の飲み薬として最初の大きな成功を収めた。",
      "selectedTextSha256": "1ff8078558bc3e05f94a47f20ecf6ccda7cd61cbf3ad013f4ed06aed75fdde50",
      "renderSha256": "03a57e33784e7a19943ffe79ed721c3bd1dd8a47d24d625f590de9e9b1965f8d"
    },
    {
      "id": "egfr-pt",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "EGFR (pt)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "egfr",
      "language": "pt",
      "available": true,
      "text": "Um receptor de crescimento mutado em alguns cânceres de pulmão e superproduzido em outros; o primeiro grande sucesso dos comprimidos-alvo.",
      "selectedTextSha256": "87279df404be57ecfda816c47a7f21fc6b6795ec4de0b7d181108c6295c83d64",
      "renderSha256": "4d18df2d4585f355cfd9da0cb758f0772d24a91baca0b1e1d95183f188737389"
    },
    {
      "id": "egfr-zh",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "EGFR (zh)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "egfr",
      "language": "zh",
      "available": true,
      "text": "一种生长受体，在部分肺癌中突变、在其他癌症中过表达；靶向药片的首个重大成功。",
      "selectedTextSha256": "7a3e53e79a881a22c596e30681b93a2752b0620786104ca3085447ad1d6de5bc",
      "renderSha256": "847bdb8af10c4c59c25688289f107c5f632da6223ca50653d82df3c9b02f7157"
    },
    {
      "id": "egfr-simple",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "EGFR (simple)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "egfr",
      "language": "simple",
      "available": true,
      "text": "A protein that tells cells to grow. It is broken in some lung cancers, and pills that block it were the first big success of targeted medicine.",
      "selectedTextSha256": "3b2ecba6aab847759744a1dea1a8f76a1c0f91a98859d812418fe3f2b8087a54",
      "renderSha256": "ddd1e6731774f135fff63547f549d0eaa59a2d88c7ff42025b94983fb6f9b2c5"
    },
